Verse 1
[Db]Under His wings I am safely a[Ab]biding, Though the
night deepens and [Fm]tempests are [Db]wild, Still I can trust Him; I
[Ebm7]know He will [Gb]keep me, He has re[Db]deemed me, and [Fm]I am His [Db]child.

